abstract: >
  SIRIUS LOCAL AI is a fully modular, offline AI runtime designed for secure,
  local-only execution of commands, workflows, plugins, and context-aware automation.
  Version 3.0.0 introduces the Intelligent Runtime architecture, including Runtime Core 3.0,
  Plugin System 3.0, Workflow Engine 3.0, AI Loop 3.0, GUI 3.0, AITE 3.0, and expanded
  household-oriented modules such as HOME_ASSISTANT, COOKING_ADVISOR, SCHOOL_HELPER,
  DEVICE_DIAGNOSTICS, IMAGE_ANALYZER, and CONTEXT_ROUTER v3.

  This version also introduces the SECURITY FAMILY module, a behavior-based identity
  and family safety layer providing OWNER/FAMILY/STRANGER identity levels, time-limits
  for children, safe-mode for unknown users, and a Schoolwork Priority Mode ensuring
  unrestricted access to academic tasks.

  The system operates entirely on the user's machine, without any cloud dependencies
  or external data transmission. All modules follow strict security boundaries,
  deterministic behavior, and predictable execution rules.

  Future versions include the Self-Repair & Health-Check Layer (v4.0.0), which provides
  integrity checks, safe automatic repairs, and diagnostic capabilities to maintain
  long-term system stability.
